            "review_title": "Review at Mars Venus romantic dining",
            "review_text": "Sarah\nThailand55 contributions\n0\nVIET NAM TOURISM - HO CHI MINH CITY\nNov 2024 • Friends\nThe restaurant space is luxurious and private, extremely romantic for couples, and classical music really suits this space. The dishes are beautifully decorated and very delicious, especially the abalone dish.\nInsider tip:\nYou should book a table before coming because the restaurant is very crowded\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 13, 2024",
